      "guid": "com.flir.betterkeys",
      "name": "Better Keys NG",
      "slug": "better-keys-ng",
      "teaser": "Get some useful info about each key. Is it required for a quest? What is behind the lock? Is it used to exit/transit ?",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2550.webp",
      "downloads": 50831,
      "favourites_count": 81,
      "description": "<h1>Features</h1>\n<p>Colored background for keys and keycards according to which map they belongs to.</p>\n<p>Maps, Extracts, Quests and Loot information in the item descriptions.</p>\n<p>Possibility to rename all keys to add a custom prefix based on the map they “belong to”.</p>\n<p>Users can copy the config.jsonc file to a file named configuser.jsonc which will be read in priority if present. This allows to keep your config while updating (You will need to copy/paste any new entry if/when they appear in the config.jsonc though)</p>\n",
