          "version": "1.3.12",
          "description": "This is the full Russian translation release\n\n\\- Added a mechanism to translate the junk key description\n\n\\- Added a description in russian for junk keys. thanks to [s3nn0m0](https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/~/28443-s3nn0m0/)\n\n\\- Changed the RU translation for 'behind the lock' to Внутри. Thanks to [eugenix](https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/~/66649-eugenix/)",
